{
  "title": "Constrictive Ring Syndrome (Streeter's Dysplasia)",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/hand/6082/constrictive-ring-syndrome-streeters-dysplasia",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Jul 24 2024",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Constriction Ring Syndrome, also known as Streeter's Dysplasia or Amniotic band syndrome, is a congenital condition that occurs when loose fibrous bands of ruptured amnion adhere to and entangle the normal developing structures of the fetus.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis is made clinically at birth with the presence of bands perpendicular to the longitudinal axis of the digit or limb with normal anatomy proximal to the constriction ring.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment is usually the release of the bands or digital reconstruction depending on the severity of digital compromise.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Epidemiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Incidence",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "1:15,000 live births",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Demographics",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "affects males and females equally",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anatomic location",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**occurs in hands and fingers 80% of the time**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "greater than 90% occur distal to wrist",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Etiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Pathophysiology",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "no firmly established etiology",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "most accepted theory is that the disrupted amnion releases fibrous membranous strands which **wrap around the developing limb in a circumferential fashion**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Genetics",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "inheritance pattern",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "sporadic and not hereditary",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Associated conditions",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": [
            {
